00:39:33.360 --> 00:39:34.160
I'll go wash up.

00:39:50.600 --> 00:39:51.880
Here, Mom.

00:39:52.640 --> 00:39:53.920
OK.

00:39:56.000 --> 00:39:56.600
Good temp?

00:39:58.560 --> 00:39:59.200
Relax.

00:40:06.600 --> 00:40:07.080
Grandma,

00:40:07.280 --> 00:40:08.280
Brought a quilt

00:40:08.320 --> 00:40:09.400
For the cold.

00:40:09.680 --> 00:40:10.760
I'll redo

00:40:10.800 --> 00:40:11.840
The bedsheets in a second.

00:40:12.560 --> 00:40:14.600
Thanks for everything!

00:40:14.920 --> 00:40:15.800
Come on.

00:40:16.240 --> 00:40:18.080
Make yourself at home.

00:40:18.960 --> 00:40:20.280
My husband and son are staying

00:40:20.400 --> 00:40:21.360
At my dad's.

00:40:22.720 --> 00:40:23.960
C'mon, I'll do it.

00:40:24.160 --> 00:40:24.960
Nah,

00:40:25.000 --> 00:40:25.400
Seriously,

00:40:25.400 --> 00:40:26.040
Stay with Grandma!

00:40:26.240 --> 00:40:28.080
You guys have helped enough.

00:40:28.440 --> 00:40:29.200
Get some rest.

00:40:29.880 --> 00:40:30.560
It's fine.

00:40:30.560 --> 00:40:31.160
You're exhausted.

00:40:31.200 --> 00:40:31.800
Stay with Grandma.

00:40:32.240 --> 00:40:33.800
Two pairs of hands

00:40:33.960 --> 00:40:35.520
Are faster!

00:40:36.120 --> 00:40:36.520
Come on,

00:40:36.680 --> 00:40:37.080
Let's go.

00:40:37.520 --> 00:40:38.000
I'll lend a hand.

00:40:41.120 --> 00:40:42.040
Here, Mom.

00:40:43.000 --> 00:40:43.800
It's cool.

00:40:44.120 --> 00:40:44.760
Let them help.

00:40:45.080 --> 00:40:45.520
OK.

00:40:45.840 --> 00:40:47.080
Lift your chin.

00:40:59.560 --> 00:41:00.080
[Hello,]

00:41:00.200 --> 00:41:01.800
[the line is busy...]

00:41:06.040 --> 00:41:07.760
[Mom, how is Grandma?]

00:41:08.440 --> 00:41:09.560
[We should]

00:41:09.560 --> 00:41:10.760
[get her checked]

00:41:12.120 --> 00:41:13.240
[tomorrow.]

00:41:47.480 --> 00:41:48.080
Qing Ye?

00:41:49.760 --> 00:41:50.360
Come in.

00:41:55.440 --> 00:41:57.000
Brought you this.

00:41:58.320 --> 00:41:59.040
Thanks.

00:42:01.160 --> 00:42:02.720
It's Kyle's charger.

00:42:03.120 --> 00:42:03.800
See

00:42:04.560 --> 00:42:05.560
If the laptop works.

00:42:09.200 --> 00:42:10.320
It was a life-and-death moment.

00:42:10.320 --> 00:42:11.640
Why did you save my laptop?

00:42:14.120 --> 00:42:15.240
It's important,

00:42:15.520 --> 00:42:16.120
Right?

00:42:16.400 --> 00:42:17.760
You are way more important!

00:42:23.120 --> 00:42:23.880
Just try it.

00:42:29.440 --> 00:42:31.320
Your hand is blistered.

00:42:35.240 --> 00:42:36.080
It's fine.

00:42:36.920 --> 00:42:37.600
Don't worry.

00:42:40.040 --> 00:42:41.360
You need burn cream.

00:42:42.400 --> 00:42:43.960
I'll go get some...

00:43:08.040 --> 00:43:08.600
Trust me,

00:43:08.600 --> 00:43:09.960
I'm fine.

00:43:10.400 --> 00:43:11.360
I heal fast.

00:43:15.440 --> 00:43:16.200
Get some rest.

00:43:19.240 --> 00:43:20.080
Xing Wu...

00:43:24.880 --> 00:43:26.160
Are you sure you're OK?

00:43:32.760 --> 00:43:33.320
Seriously,

00:43:33.880 --> 00:43:34.920
I'm fine.

00:43:35.680 --> 00:43:37.520
I'll just put some ice pops

00:43:37.520 --> 00:43:38.520
On it.

00:43:39.120 --> 00:43:40.000
It'll soothe the burn.

